    "directions": [
      "In a large bowl, add butter, brown sugar, and castor sugar cream until smooth.",
      "Beat the eggs one at a time into the sugar mixture, then stir in the vanilla essence and whisk it well.",
      "Add refined flour, baking powder and mix it well.",
      "Add chocolate chips and mix until it forms a soft cookie dough.",
      "Spread the cookie dough on a heavy bottom pan.",
      "Cook on a slow flame for 30-35 minutes.",
      "Switch off the flame. Allow it to cool for 10 minutes before serving topped with ice cream and chocolate syrup."
